  <!--EN: unstable laser revolver shot-->
  <VWEFT_Bullet_SalvagedLaserRevolver.label>不稳定激光束</VWEFT_Bullet_SalvagedLaserRevolver.label>
  <!--EN: A scoped marksmen laser rifle capable of firing unstable light at very long range, supposedly used for mag train robberies long ago.\n\nBy using makeshift battery cells, this weapon is capable of quickly warming up, boosting the firing speed with each consecutive shot when standing still.-->
  <VWEFT_Gun_SalvagedLaserHuntingRifle.description>一种能够在极远距离发射不稳定光线的瞄准镜式射手步枪，据说很久以前用于抢劫运输弹药的火车。\n\n该武器通过使用临时电池来进行预热，连续射击可以显著的提高射击速度。\n\n这把武器在完全预热后会高速过热，从而导致武器中的电池发生爆炸。</VWEFT_Gun_SalvagedLaserHuntingRifle.description>
  <!--EN: salvaged laser hunting rifle-->
  <VWEFT_Gun_SalvagedLaserHuntingRifle.label>组装激光狩猎步枪</VWEFT_Gun_SalvagedLaserHuntingRifle.label>
  <!--EN: barrel-->
  <VWEFT_Gun_SalvagedLaserHuntingRifle.tools.0.label>枪管</VWEFT_Gun_SalvagedLaserHuntingRifle.tools.0.label>
  <!--EN: grip-->
  <VWEFT_Gun_SalvagedLaserHuntingRifle.tools.1.label>握把</VWEFT_Gun_SalvagedLaserHuntingRifle.tools.1.label>
  <!--EN: Standard-->
  <VWEFT_Gun_SalvagedLaserHuntingRifle.verbs.0.label>标准射击装置</VWEFT_Gun_SalvagedLaserHuntingRifle.verbs.0.label>
  <!--EN: A salvaged repeating rifle capable of firing unstable light at both close and medium distance, surprisingly accurate.\n\nBy using makeshift battery cells, this weapon is capable of quickly warming up, boosting the firing speed with each consecutive shot when standing still.-->
  <VWEFT_Gun_SalvagedLaserRepeater.description>重组的连发步枪，能够在近距离和中距离发射不稳定激光束，精度惊人。\n\n该武器通过使用临时电池来进行预热，连续射击可以显著的提高射击速度。\n\n这把武器在完全预热后会高速过热，从而导致武器中的电池发生爆炸。</VWEFT_Gun_SalvagedLaserRepeater.description>
