  <!--EN: A drum-based laser pistol capable of heating up quite quickly, each chamber containing an individual microbattery primed to focus each shot.\n\nBy using makeshift battery cells, this weapon is capable of quickly warming up, boosting the firing speed with each consecutive shot when standing still.-->
  <VWEFT_Gun_SalvagedLaserRevolver.description>弹筒式激光手枪，能够迅速地加热，每个弹膛里都有一个独立的微型电池，使其每次射击都能聚焦。\n\n该武器通过使用临时电池来进行预热，连续射击可以显著的提高射击速度。\n\n这把武器在完全预热后会高速过热，从而导致武器中的电池发生爆炸。</VWEFT_Gun_SalvagedLaserRevolver.description>
